Minimal skeleton

python
from fastapi import FastAPI, HTTPException
from pydantic import BaseModel, Field

app = FastAPI()

class Req(BaseModel):
    prompt: str = Field(min_length=10, max_length=600)
    genre: str
    style: str
    panels: int = Field(ge=2, le=8)

@app.post("/api/generate")
async def generate(req: Req):
    script = await make_script(req)          # Gemini text
    images = await make_images(script, req)  # Gemini image, parallel
    return {"title": script["title"],
            "panels": [{**p, "image": img} for p, img in zip(script["panels"], images)]}

Best practices: keep secrets in .env, serve the HTML from FastAPI's static files so /api/generate is same-origin, and commit often.
